OL,3,GNEWSAWar of words over HMOs as council
OL,4,Arefusals overturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city council's decision to declare a
OL,7,Fseries of houses of multiple occupation
OL,8,F(HMOs) unlawful has been overruled on
OL,9,Fappeal.
OL,11,FAfter four properties were deemed to be
OL,12,Finappropriate as HMOs by Liverpool City
OL,13,FCouncil earlier this year, the Planning
OL,14,FInspectorate stepped in to overturn the
OL,15,Fdecision.
OL,17,FThe ruling comes as the row over the
OL,18,Fcouncil's use of HMOs has heated up
OL,19,Fwith the local authority's housing
OL,20,Fchief, Hetty Wood, saying
OL,21,F"fearmongering and dog-whistle
OL,22,Fpolitics" was driving misinformation.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
