OL,3,GNEWSAWar of words over HMOs as council
OL,4,Arefusals overturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe comments were condemned by
OL,7,Fopposition figures, with the Liberal
OL,8,Fgroup leader Steve Radford calling for
OL,9,Fher to resign for being "out of touch"
OL,10,Fwith the legitimate concerns of local
OL,11,Fresidents.
